  rorNote: "Even a positive-expectancy system can blow up if you bet too big. Halving your risk per trade cuts risk of ruin far more than it cuts returns.",
  heatTitle: "Portfolio Heat",
  heatIntro: "Your total open risk — what you'd lose if every open position hit its stop at once. Cap this, not just per-trade risk.",
  heatPosition: "Position",
  heatAddPosition: "Add position",
